# Job Match 🎯

Give it your resume. It searches **104 人力銀行**, **Cake** and **LinkedIn**, and returns your **top 10 matching jobs**:

```
1. 範例科技股份有限公司 - [Python 後端工程師](https://www.104.com.tw/job/8abcd)
2. Acme Corp - [Backend Engineer](https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4012345678)
...
```

| | |
|---|---|
| **Input** | Resume file: `.pdf`, `.docx`, `.txt`, `.md` |
| **Platforms** | https://www.104.com.tw · https://www.cake.me · https://www.linkedin.com |
| **Output** | Top 10 jobs as `<Company> - [<Job Title>](<Job URL>)`, in the terminal and saved to `output/results.md` + `output/results.json` |

