## 4. Roadmap: Phase 1 / 2 / 3

**MVP** means *Minimum Viable Product*: the first, simplest version that already does its main job.

Think of building a car 🚗. The MVP has wheels, an engine, a steering wheel and brakes, so it can already take you somewhere. Air conditioning, GPS and a sunroof come later. They make the car nicer, but you can drive without them.

| Phase | Status | What it includes |
|---|---|---|
| **Phase 1 (MVP)** | ✅ Built | Resume → search 104 / Cake / LinkedIn → AI matching → top 10. AI techniques 1–4 |
| **Phase 2** | Planned | Better match quality, lower cost, more safety: techniques 5–10 and 16–22 |
| **Phase 3** | Planned | Evaluation, market insights, learning from your feedback, automation: techniques 11–15 and 23–28 |

See [AI Techniques → Planned](#planned-phase-2-and-phase-3) for the full list.

